Subject: Adapt gitlab-exporter Sidekiq probe for Sidekiq 7 / redis-client
Origin: DHI-internal (Sidekiq 7 compatibility; upstream still pins 6.5.12)
Description: DHI bumps Sidekiq to ~> 7.3 for the Sinatra 4 / Rack 3 CVE path.
 Sidekiq 7 rejects assigning a ConnectionPool to config.redis, uses
 redis-client (RedisClient::* errors, sentinel name required), and treats a
 present :sentinels key as sentinel mode even when nil. Rewrite with_sidekiq,
 redis_options, connected?, and probe_workers for that client API.
Forwarded: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/ruby/gems/gitlab-exporter/-/issues/105
Upstream source: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/ruby/gems/gitlab-exporter/-/blob/16.10.0/lib/gitlab_exporter/sidekiq.rb
Base tree:
 Package: gitlab-exporter
 Tag: 16.10.0
 Layout: repository root after git checkout of tag 16.10.0
Files: lib/gitlab_exporter/sidekiq.rb

